name: watcher-off-path
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a guard, wall, or publish step existed but the normal run path
  could not reach it — logic sound, reach zero. Fires when a commit's
  fix is wiring an already-correct step INTO the path, not changing
  the step's logic. The publish pipeline stranded three boards this
  way (2026-09-22); the parallel-path coherence watchers before that.
